<title>UK: Ugland Nordic interim results due Aug 25.</title>
<headline>Ugland Nordic interim results due Aug 25.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ugland Nordic Shipping, formerly Nordic American Shipping, will report its interim results on August 25, not August 5 as previously reported, the Norwegian shipping company said.</p>
